    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5044" root="جث" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُثٌّ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثٌّ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>Elevated ground</i> (S,
TA, but not in all the copies of the former) <i>such
as has a form visible from a distance:</i> (TA:) or
<i>ground that is elevated so as to be like a small</i>
[<i>hill of the kind called</i>]<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَمَة</span>. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  The
<i>envelope</i> of fruit; (K;) [or of the spadix of a
palm-tree;] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُفٌّ</span>; the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ث</span> being a substitute
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ف</span>. (TA.)

